          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba abantu bami bayiziwula, abangazi; bangabantwana ababuthakathaka, futhi abanakuqonda; bahlakaniphile ekwenzeni okubi, kepha ukwenza okuhle abakwazi.",
          "type": "text",
